#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:3 16abf4de39e44dd1a07b7239ab8dfe41
msgid "**ARCHIVED SETUP INSTRUCTIONS PRIOR TO COPTER 3.6 VERSIONS**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:6 3f8645c2b330480091900ce20a03631a
msgid "Copter 3.4.x"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:8 09c6d80312764972ae734e637771d2b4
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE <MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE>`: tail servo's maximum lean "
"angle in degrees.  This allows for the rear motor's thrust to be adjusted"
" appropriately depending upon the lean angle.  The default is 30 degrees."
"  \"0\" would mean the tail servo can only point directly up (which would"
" not allow the vehicle to fly), \"90\" means the tail servo can point "
"horizontally."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:10 b1a659f0e12643828a70754e903d9cec
msgid ""
"The channel used for the tail servo can be changed from its default "
"(channel 7) by setting the appropriate SERVOx_FUNCTION to 39.  For "
"example the :ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` only has 6 output "
"channels so the tail servo can be moved to output channel 5 by setting "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION <SERVO5_FUNCTION>` to 39."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:12 89fcfd9719274b9bbdb8f21c93c0cf79
msgid "See Copter 3.3 section below for more parameters that can be adjusted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:15 d6ea538714784e599b9202d26eb1557b
msgid "Copter 3.3.x"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:17 b9786ac4a93146cf95e1ad9e6e4e30ca
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_MIN <MOT_YAW_SV_MIN>``: tail servo's lowest PWM value before"
" binding occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:18 55405070e47a49a7bf0b622911c41b94
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_MAX <MOT_YAW_SV_MAX>``: tail servo's highest PWM value "
"before binding occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:19 b33434cbea6f4647836f8e97838ee202
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_TRIM <MOT_YAW_SV_TRIM>``: tail servo's PWM value close to "
"what is required to keep the tail from spinning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:20 74eacad1a2d5475c8e8ad7ae6e4c564c
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_REV <MOT_YAW_SV_REV>``: tail servo's reverse setting.  +1 = "
"servo moves in default direction, -1 to reverse direction of movement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:23 ddd53a08356a411f8161ce80b3959c82
msgid "Copter 3.2.1 (and earlier)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:25 0bfb300fcc4a47b78ffd889eb9779abe
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_MIN>`: tail servo's lowest PWM value before binding "
"occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:26 75b80ac95f6c401cbfb761065158c2c2
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_MAX <RC7_MAX>`: tail servo's highest PWM value before binding "
"occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:27 d158076e30ee4c8a9bc3e716912db4e7
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_TRIM>`: tail servo's PWM value close to what is "
"required to keep the tail from spinning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:28 92302e2d75174bf9ba51e5a792dcd7e0
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_REVERSED <RC7_REVERSED>`: tail servo's reverse setting.  +1 = "
"servo moves in default direction, -1 to reverse direction of movement."
msgstr ""

